  Design: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a15b7bd9faee4db6abb91aa8ea58bd0, type: 2}
  DesignerSolution: "T\u1ED5ng h\u1EE3p: phanh, \u0111i v\xF2ng v\u1EADt c\u1EA3n,
    \u0111\u1ED5i h\u01B0\u1EDBng v\xE0 c\u0103n l\u1ED1i; kh\xF4ng c\xF3 c\u1EEDa
    ho\u1EB7c c\u01A1 c\u1EA5u \u0111\u1ED9ng m\u1EDBi. B\u1ED1 tr\xED: P15 \u2014
    m\u1EB7t n\u1EA1 s\u01B0 t\u1EED, b\u1ED1 tr\xED l\u1EA1i th\xE0nh 2\u20133 ch\u1EB7ng
    nh\xECn r\xF5.\nRecovery: C\xE1c s\xE2n \u1EDF tr\xE1n v\xE0 m\xE1 gi\u1EEF bi
    khi \u0111i qu\xE1; hai ph\xEDa m\xF5m \u0111\u1EC1u l\xE0 nghi\u1EC7m h\u1EE3p
    l\u1EC7; kh\xF4ng m\u1EA5t to\xE0n b\u1ED9 h\xE0nh tr\xECnh v\xEC m\u1ED9t va
    ch\u1EA1m cu\u1ED1i"
